From eb5c9b0d84b1b0afffecea0cf040e94017d6b8f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Intel MPSS <mpss@intel.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:57:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/16] x86/mic: KNC platform headers

From Intel MPSS 3.8.6, unchanged: the SBOX/GBOX register maps and
their helpers (asm/mic/mic_knc/*, micreghelper.h), the platform
interface used by the KNC arch code (mic_def.h, mic_common.h), the
micpm device interface, and the mic_dma headers shared with the
out-of-tree card modules.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
